bin/
# Root-anchored: the `go build ./cmd/deploymate` binary lands at ./deploymate.
# WITHOUT the leading slash this also matches the cmd/deploymate/ SOURCE dir,
# which silently un-tracked the whole main package (main.go, seed.go, …).
/deploymate

